"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100051901,"comment_content":"其实有一个非常肯定和感谢的地方，就是你彻底打败我想快速学习英语的梦想。其实之前一直在找学习的方法，后来慢慢发现学习语言还是得慢，不断积累多查词汇，查词汇还得注意关联性，查的时候不要忘记跟读，看看自己读的发音是否正确，多去模仿，造句。\n目前逐渐养成下面的习惯：\n1.看文章，先跳读\n2.在看文章细读\n3.对存在阅读障碍的单词进行查询，跟读，如果能够造句就甚好\n4.最后就是看看原文别人的翻译，跟自己的理解是否一致，或者有比翻译更好的地方。\n5.反复听好音频或者视频的资料\n6.复习单词","like_count":24},{"had_liked":false,"id":259131,"user_name":"夏天","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1247485,"ip_address":"","ucode":"95DD5C15BBAFFD","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/13/08/fd/8121b2bc.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1604635994,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100051901,"comment_content":"师者，传道授业解惑。陈老师这门课，不厌其烦的讲单词、语法，此授业。毫无保留的讲学英语的方法论，不迎合、不炒作、实事求是，此传道。\n\n我个人想在阅读上精进，如有可能，期待陈老师开第二季-《英语阅读课》，通过阅读，以面带点的熏陶英语的阅读理解能力","like_count":3},{"had_liked":false,"id":235910,"user_name":"端点星好运","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1359893,"ip_address":"","ucode":"AA48B23A1C4317","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/14/c0/15/be72b945.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1595240193,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100051901,"comment_content":"蹲一个第二季","like_count":3},{"had_liked":false,"id":271228,"user_name":"enjoylearning","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1000237,"ip_address":"","ucode":"DCAF8538DEA277","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1609481992,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100051901,"comment_content":"感觉作者是一个很有境界的人，也提现了作者说的英语只是一个工具，从这门课学到了很多有意思的思维和方法论","like_count":2},{"had_liked":false,"id":250430,"user_name":"taffy","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":2080972,"ip_address":"","ucode":"673D7E57128FA0","user_header":"https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTJibGyBoezX8KfJZSE5w7v2EiaZCKY4bDJKsFmbibzVzmHjjOh4kR7zBuo7sOhdvOLuc6e4rOlZy9Mbw/132","c